  "description": "On-device LLM inference for Circle. Alibaba MNN P/Invoke layer with Qwen 3 chat generator. 1.3.6 adds linux-arm64 by building MNN 3.5.0 from source (Alibaba doesn't ship a prebuilt). Cross-compiled on Ubuntu 24.04 x86_64 via aarch64-linux-gnu-g++ 13.3 toolchain in 20 minutes. Ships libmnnbridge.so (68 KB stripped, aarch64 ELF, 19 mnn_* symbols, DT_NEEDED for libllm.so + libMNN_Express.so + libMNN.so) + libMNN.so (3 MB), libllm.so (1.2 MB), libMNN_Express.so (987 KB). 8 RIDs total: win-x64, linux-x64, linux-arm64, osx-arm64, osx-x64, android-arm64, android-arm, ios-arm64. 1.3.5 added android-arm + ios-arm64.",
